nglish and Chinese, including Mandarin Proficiency in computer skills, including MS Office and Chinese word processing 申請方法 Interested parties please submit a cover letter, together with a full resume indicating your availability, present and expected salary (insufficient information may not be considered). Please quote the Position Title that you will apply for, and send the application by email to hronline@hkct.edu.hk or by mail to the Human Resources Department, HKCT Jockey Club Ma On Shan Campus, 2 Hang Hong Street, Yiu On Estate, Ma On Shan. The personal data provided will be treated in strict confidence and used for recruitment purposes only. Candidates not invited for an interview within 6 weeks may consider their application unsuccessful. 加入我們 關於港專 認識港專 港專學院 香港專業進修學校 傳媒中心 資料庫 加入我們 課程 學習程度 興趣 入學資訊 入學申請 費用及獎學金 內地生入學資訊 港專優勢 升學階梯 非本地生入學資訊 教與學 學生服務 教學地點 教學設施 教研中心 圖書館 港專網絡 僱主網絡及服務 港專校友 專業學會 海外合作院校 中學網絡及服務 與業界協作項目 捐贈港專 與我們聯繫 網站地圖 聯絡我們 免責條例 個人資料私隱政策 惡劣天氣安排 版權所有 © 2026年 港專"
